                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Jugemu and his friends defeat a horde of monsters known as \"core bearers\" that are attacking the city. However, a new horde of core bearers appears along with the \"Masked Man\" and attacks Linne's mansion. Jugemu and his friends fight back, but are overwhelmed by the immense power of the Gourai-class monster \"Shringara\" that the masked man summons. Then the masked man reaches out his hand to Linne...!",
                        "jpn": "街を襲う怪物《コア持ち》の群れを撃破したジュゲムたち。しかし新たなるコア持ちの群れが《仮面の男》と共に現れ、リンネの屋敷を襲う。迎え撃つジュゲムたち。しかし仮面の男が呼び出した轟絶級モンスター《シュリンガーラ》の絶大な力に圧倒されてしまう。そして仮面の男の手がリンネへと伸びる……！"
